Add-ReviewFinding 'N26' 'ADD-AC' 'low' 96 'D1 R15 propagation without dropping synthetic 1.3' 'R15 and D5 explicitly preserve synthetic 1.3 coverage, while PLAN-VSFLOCKSTEP-001:340 is the synthetic 1.2/1.3/1.4 matrix, not just an external-input list. Exit:96 still mentions an optional AC1 v1.3 input blocker even though R15 resolved that missing real input.' 'The explicit semantic ruling and preservation clause govern, so no safety gap remains. A small propagation assertion prevents an implementer from replacing the synthetic matrix or retaining a superseded blocker branch.' 'D1 readback must show external real AC1 inputs 1.2/1.4, unchanged synthetic 1.2/1.3/1.4 cases and AC2 semantics; remove the obsolete optional real-v1.3 blocker phrase and reconcile requirement/plan/projection blocker lists.'
